# Bells, conducting Plain Bob Minor: the test player makes the calls the hint gives: round at the length set, a touch
# counted; then a touch with no calls: it ends with a result (round on target only if the plain course is the length
# set), said with the way it could have gone
wait 800
tap PLAY
wait 100
turn K4 2
wait 50
expect bells_mode 2
turn K3 -6
wait 50
shot stand.png
autoconduct on
tap PLAY
wait 3000
shot calling.png
wait 120000
expect ringing 0
expect bells_result 1
expect touches 1
shot round.png
autoconduct off
tap PLAY
wait 120000
expect ringing 0
expect bells_result >0
